WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Download the package for your browser from the Claritas website.

2
00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
Unzip it into a folder.

3
00:12.000 --> 00:17.000
Open about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox.

4
00:18.000 --> 00:26.000
Choose “Load Temporary Add-on” and select manifest.json.

5
00:27.000 --> 00:34.000
Claritas is loaded. Open it from the toolbar.

6
00:35.000 --> 00:41.000
Firefox removes temporary add-ons when it restarts. For a permanent install, sign the package as an unlisted add-on.
